    "rich_text_pQjjkK": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_EJnqAH": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "4. It Is Safe"
          }
        },
        "text_UCfGD6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you are seeking an alternative to medications for managing pain and inflammation, consider trying red light therapy. This treatment is a natural and safe way to improve your health and well-being without causing negative side effects like liver damage, stomach irritation, constipation, and other common side-effects from drug-induced pain relief.</p><p>Red light therapy can provide whole-body healing without any of these risks, making it a potentially more effective and healthier option for managing pain and inflammation.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_EJnqAH",
