      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_iwMpP8": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "6. <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34947870/\">Accelerate Recovery</a>"
          }
        },
        "text_X3nXCn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Red light therapy can help athletes to run faster and recover more quickly after intense workouts. The improved circulation and reduced inflammation resulting from red light therapy treatment can accelerate recovery times, allowing athletes to train harder and more frequently.</p><p>A short session of red light therapy after a workout can help to reduce inflammation, alleviate sore muscles, and support the recovery process, enabling athletes to bounce back more quickly and be ready for their next training session.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
