        "heading_JxWKVd": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "9. Relaxation"
          }
        },
        "text_xp68z9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Red light therapy treatments in a bed can be a relaxing and meditative experience, providing a rare opportunity to spend 20 quiet minutes lying down in a comfortable, warm (but not hot) environment without any disruptions.</p><p>These sessions are typically as short as 20 minutes, but can still be long enough to allow you to take a power nap and shake off the stress of the day.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
