    "rich_text_jEEwtb": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_kmME8y": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "10. <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35169872/\">Support Weight Loss</a> & <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/28328287/\">Cellulite Reduction</a>"
          }
        },
        "text_aBJpWt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Red light therapy has been shown to be effective in promoting weight loss, with some research indicating that the fat loss rate can nearly double when combined with diet and exercise.</p><p>If you are working on weight loss, red light therapy may be able to help you reach your goals more quickly. In addition to its weight loss benefits, red light therapy is also the only scientifically proven method for reducing cellulite.</p><p>When used in combination with massage, red light therapy has been shown to lead to a 71% reduction in cellulite.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
