          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "11. Reduce Feelings of <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32144511/\">Anxiety & Depression</a>"
          }
        },
        "text_C9rfJa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>According to research, red light therapy may be able to bring about measurable improvements in conditions such as post-traumatic stress disorder (PTSD), depression, and anxiety, as well as in lifestyle factors that can impact mental health, such as sleep and stress.</p>"
          }
        }
