        "heading_hELFWe": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "12. <a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33636371/\">Boost Energy & Fight Fatigue</a>"
          }
        },
        "text_qDWafa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Red light therapy has the ability to enhance energy production at the cellular level, which can lead to improved function of the entire body. If you suffer from chronic fatigue, consistent red light therapy treatments may be able to dramatically improve your symptoms.</p><p>Red light therapy is known to increase endurance and energy levels, making it a potentially effective treatment option for those who struggle with fatigue.</p>"
          }
        }
