      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_yeNa7n": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "13. <a href=\"https://www.healthline.com/health/why-not-to-have-red-lights-on-at-night\">Better Sleep</a>"
          }
        },
        "text_9tm6f7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>There are few things that can compare to the benefits of a good night’s sleep, and many people who use red light therapy report that they experience consistently better and deeper sleep as one of the first benefits they notice.</p><p>Improved sleep can create a strong foundation for healing and feeling better overall.</p>"
          }
        }
