      "blocks": {
        "heading_dWDUdn": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "15.<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34325071/\"> Improved Cognitive Function & Brain Health</a>"
          }
        },
        "text_N9wmcB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Red light therapy treatments can help to support brain health by improving blood flow and oxygenation, promoting the growth of new neurons, protecting neurons from damage, reducing inflammation, and repairing cells.</p><p>These effects can in turn lead to improved memory, faster learning, and an ability to process complex problems more quickly.</p>"
          }
        }
